OL,3,GNEWSA'Menace' driver tried to bite
OL,4,Aofficers after chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver whose behaviour was described
OL,7,Fby police as "the most shocking" they
OL,8,Fhad ever seen has been jailed.
OL,10,FMartin Stokes, 20, failed to stop for
OL,11,Fofficers and was chased along the M4 in
OL,12,FWiltshire, reaching speeds of up to
OL,13,F140mph, before driving the wrong way up
OL,14,Fthe A419 and the A420.
OL,16,FSwindon Crown Court heard that he
OL,17,Frammed police vehicles as they tried to
OL,18,Fblock him in, before assaulting and
OL,19,Fthreatening to kill emergency workers.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
