OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1792218364
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'Menace' driver tried to bite
OL,4,Aofficers after chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FStokes, of no fixed abode, admitted a
OL,7,Fstring of offences at a hearing on 10
OL,8,FJuly, and was jailed for two years and
OL,9,Feight months at Swindon Crown Court
OL,10,Fearlier. The judge described him as "a
OL,11,Fcomplete menace" who he would jail for
OL,12,Flonger if sentencing rules allowed.
